# Local MCP server configuration.
#
# `.mcp.json` carries a client-specific Supabase project_ref. This repository is
# the MASTER template, so committing one client's ref would point every store
# created from it at that client's database (AGENTS.md sections 9 and 25).
# Copy .mcp.json.example and fill in your own ref instead.
.mcp.json

# Skill symlinks generated by `npx skills add`.
#
# These are ABSOLUTE symlinks into the installing machine's home directory, so
# committing them gives every other clone a set of broken links. The skills
# themselves live in .agents/skills/ and are tracked; this directory is just the
# per-tool view of them and is recreated by `npx skills add`.
.claude/skills/
